# Bloodletter of Aclazotz wears Basilisk Collar (deathtouch and lifelink) and attacks Bot2 on Bot1's turn 3. Its 2 combat
# damage makes Bot2 lose 2 life (CR 120.3a), which Bloodletter doubles to 4 (20 -> 16). The damage itself is still 2, so
# lifelink gains Bot1 only 2 (CR 120.3f; Bloodletter's 2023-11-10 ruling: a 1/1 lifelinker makes the opponent lose 2 and
# you gain 1): 20 -> 22, not 24.

